{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>亞殘運游泳，陳睿琳於女子蝶泳為香港奪今屆第二金。</p><p></p><p>女子S14級100米蝶泳決賽，陳睿琳游出1分05秒19，以0.37秒優勢力壓日本泳手奪金。這位亞洲紀錄保持者實現亞殘運三連霸，隊友劉肖儀獲得銅牌，時間1分07秒39。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T12:02:17.275430+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T11:14:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T11:57:50.126064+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T11:57:50.126064+00:00","content_hash":"fc6364425ef2c10fa7890fdb018cf81d62eaf8b73a70b5c2a49a43f791245845","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}